{%- comment -%}
  pg-cart-zfix
  Cart drawer stacking fix.

  The drawer footer (.sticky-in-panel) is position:sticky at z-index 5.
  The orb offer card (#pg-unlock-slot .pg-offer) renders its ORB 1/2/3 and
  FREE ORB pickers as .pg-offer-pick at position:relative z-index 2, and on
  mobile Safari those select menus were painting through the footer, so the
  subtotal, shipping protection and total rows ended up underneath them.

  Fix: give the footer a clearly higher layer, and give every scrolling block
  in the drawer its own stacking context pinned below it, so nothing inside
  them can climb out. No media query needed, this applies on mobile and
  desktop alike.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%} 2026-10 speed (css-layers): this file's CSS now lives in assets/pgs-cart.css (search its banner for this file name), linked from layout/theme.liquid between the header-group and overlay-group, which keeps the cascade order it had here. Edit it there. {%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%}
  2026-11-03 CART PHOTOS: FLOATING SHOT ON PLAIN WHITE.
  Owner: "make sure cart photos are the floating w in the white background".

  Every console / hoodie / X50 variant image is already the transparent
  "floating" PNG (fl-*.png), so the cart line shows the right photo. What it
  sat on was pr.css's
    html body.pr-page aside#cart#cart#cart#cart ul.l4ca picture
      { background: var(--pr-panel) !important }   (#F5F3F9 lavender)
  which drew a lavender tile behind it. Five ids beat that rule's four, so the
  tile is now white and the product floats on the white drawer.

  On a phone the thumbnail box is 78x120, and object-fit:cover cut the sides
  off the wide consoles (R36H / R36H Ultra). Floating shots only (matched by
  the fl- file name) switch to contain, so the whole device shows; the white
  letterbox above and below is invisible on the white drawer. Square desktop
  boxes look the same either way. Orbs and accessories have no floating shot
  and keep cover, so their photos still fill the box.

  Kept here as inline CSS, not in pgs-cart.css, because that file is 203KB.

  2026-11-03 (later) FLOAT + BIGGER. Owner, from a phone on the draft: "Do the
  photos float? Can u make the cart image bigger look".
  - They did not float: the fl-*.png files are plain cut-outs with no shadow.
    The product page makes them float with pr.css's pr-lev2 bob (4.6s, -4%)
    and an elliptical radial shadow under the product (pr-levshadow). The cart
    now does the same: a soft shadow under each floating shot and a gentle bob,
    staggered per line, off for prefers-reduced-motion.
  - They looked small because the product fills only part of each file: the
    R36S Pro / Ultra / Ultra Max are 44% of the frame wide and 70% tall, the
    hoodie 52% x 70%, the R36H Pro / Ultra 70% x 41%, the X50 80% x 54%. Each
    family is now enlarged to fill its box: up to 92% of the box width and
    80% of its height, the shadow taking the rest. Measured from the files'
    alpha channels, so nothing is cropped.
  - The box is 120x140 (was 120x120) from 420px up, and 86x120 (was 78x120)
    on smaller phones. Height costs nothing in the text column; the 8px of
    width on small phones leaves 232px of text at 360px wide.
  Geometry: the image is an L x L square, L = the largest size at which the
  product fits both limits; it is placed so product + gap + shadow sit centred
  in the box. All of it is calc() on the vars below, so a new floating family
  only needs its four numbers. The family is read with :has() on the figure
  (the shadow lives on the figure); without :has the fallback numbers fit
  every family uncropped, just without the per-family tuning or a shadow.
{%- endcomment -%}
<style>
  html body aside#cart#cart#cart#cart#cart .l4ca:not(.in-panel) > li > figure,
  html body aside#cart#cart#cart#cart#cart .l4ca:not(.in-panel) > li > figure picture{
    background:#fff !important;
  }

  /* Box size, and the default numbers (safe for every floating family) */
  html body aside#cart#cart#cart#cart#cart .l4ca:not(.in-panel) > li > figure{
    --bw:120px; --bh:140px;
    --pw:.8; --ph:.7; --pcy:.5;
    --L:min(calc(var(--bw) * .92 / var(--pw)), calc(var(--bh) * .8 / var(--ph)));
    --pt:calc((var(--bh) - var(--ph) * var(--L) - var(--bh) * .09) / 2);
    width:var(--bw) !important; min-width:var(--bw) !important; max-width:var(--bw) !important;
    height:var(--bh) !important; min-height:var(--bh) !important; max-height:var(--bh) !important;
    flex:0 0 var(--bw) !important;
    position:relative !important; overflow:hidden !important;
  }
  @media (max-width:419px){
    html body aside#cart#cart#cart#cart#cart .l4ca:not(.in-panel) > li > figure{ --bw:86px; --bh:120px; }
  }

  /* Product size and position inside each family's file (from the alpha channel) */
  html body aside#cart#cart#cart#cart#cart .l4ca:not(.in-panel) > li > figure:has(img[src*="/files/fl-pro-"]),
  html body aside#cart#cart#cart#cart#cart .l4ca:not(.in-panel) > li > figure:has(img[src*="/files/fl-ultra-"]),
  html body aside#cart#cart#cart#cart#cart .l4ca:not(.in-panel) > li > figure:has(img[src*="/files/fl-max-"]){ --pw:.44; --ph:.7; --pcy:.49; }
  html body aside#cart#cart#cart#cart#cart .l4ca:not(.in-panel) > li > figure:has(img[src*="/files/fl-hoodie-"]){ --pw:.52; --ph:.7; --pcy:.49; }
  html body aside#cart#cart#cart#cart#cart .l4ca:not(.in-panel) > li > figure:has(img[src*="/files/fl-h-"]),
  html body aside#cart#cart#cart#cart#cart .l4ca:not(.in-panel) > li > figure:has(img[src*="/files/fl-hu-"]){ --pw:.7; --ph:.41; --pcy:.635; }
  html body aside#cart#cart#cart#cart#cart .l4ca:not(.in-panel) > li > figure:has(img[src*="/files/fl-x50-"]){ --pw:.8; --ph:.54; --pcy:.52; }

  /* Photos with no floating shot (orbs, cases, kits): fill the box as before */
  html body aside#cart#cart#cart#cart#cart .l4ca:not(.in-panel) > li > figure img:not([src*="/files/fl-"]){
    top:0 !important; left:0 !important; right:auto !important; bottom:auto !important;
    width:100% !important; height:100% !important; max-width:none !important; max-height:none !important;
    object-fit:cover !important;
  }

  /* Floating shots: enlarged, centred over their shadow, bobbing */
  html body aside#cart#cart#cart#cart#cart .l4ca:not(.in-panel) > li > figure img[src*="/files/fl-"]{
    position:absolute !important;
    left:calc((var(--bw) - var(--L)) / 2) !important;
    top:calc(var(--pt) - (var(--pcy) - var(--ph) / 2) * var(--L)) !important;
    right:auto !important; bottom:auto !important;
    width:var(--L) !important; height:var(--L) !important;
    max-width:none !important; max-height:none !important;
    object-fit:contain !important;
    background:transparent !important;
    z-index:1;
    animation:pg-cfloat 4.6s ease-in-out infinite;
    -webkit-backface-visibility:hidden; backface-visibility:hidden;
  }
  html body aside#cart#cart#cart#cart#cart .l4ca:not(.in-panel) > li > figure:has(img[src*="/files/fl-"])::after{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    z-index:0;
    pointer-events:none;
    right:auto; bottom:auto; margin:0; border:0; border-radius:0; box-shadow:none; opacity:1;
    width:calc(var(--pw) * var(--L) * .8);
    left:calc((var(--bw) - var(--pw) * var(--L) * .8) / 2);
    top:calc(var(--pt) + var(--ph) * var(--L) + var(--bh) * .025);
    height:calc(var(--bh) * .055);
    background:radial-gradient(closest-side, rgba(24,12,48,.34), rgba(24,12,48,0));
    animation:pg-cfloat-sh 4.6s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  html body aside#cart#cart#cart#cart#cart .l4ca:not(.in-panel) > li:nth-child(3n+2) > figure img[src*="/files/fl-"],
  html body aside#cart#cart#cart#cart#cart .l4ca:not(.in-panel) > li:nth-child(3n+2) > figure::after{ animation-delay:-1.5s; }
  html body aside#cart#cart#cart#cart#cart .l4ca:not(.in-panel) > li:nth-child(3n+3) > figure img[src*="/files/fl-"],
  html body aside#cart#cart#cart#cart#cart .l4ca:not(.in-panel) > li:nth-child(3n+3) > figure::after{ animation-delay:-3s; }
  @keyframes pg-cfloat{ 0%,100%{ transform:translate3d(0,0,0); } 50%{ transform:translate3d(0,-2.5%,0); } }
  @keyframes pg-cfloat-sh{ 0%,100%{ transform:scaleX(1); opacity:1; } 50%{ transform:scaleX(.8); opacity:.6; } }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
    html body aside#cart#cart#cart#cart#cart .l4ca:not(.in-panel) > li > figure img[src*="/files/fl-"],
    html body aside#cart#cart#cart#cart#cart .l4ca:not(.in-panel) > li > figure::after{ animation:none !important; }
  }
</style>

